ult of this it can be  hard to find out who exactly he calls  his girlfriend's the handsome star has  been seen hanging out with Taylor spyler  and chloe moretz  however he has denied being  an item with either of these ladies  instead Robinson has claimed to they are  his friends Robinson and Moretz Metz  while filming the fifth wave together  and they've kept in touch ever since  swab rumors may have circulated that  they were more than just friends Buress  is currently dating Maze Runner actor  Dylan O'Brien this allows us to shift  our focus to sprite ler who was  Robinson's on-screen sister in Melissa  and Joey a source once confirmed that  Robinson had feelings for his co-star  however the actor himself has never  brought his dating life to lights for  now we're left to believe that there's a  serious love triangle going around some  fans have speculated that Robinson likes  Moretz but can't date her so he's  pursuing sprite ler but for the time  being let's just accept the fact that  this handsome star is single he lost the  role of Augustus waters to Ansel Elgort  when a movie like The Fault in Our Stars  is casting actors it's only normal for  competitive nature to kick in author  john green's novel took the world by  storm which prompted directors to put it  on the big screen casting the lead of  Augustus waters proved to be challenging  especially since five amazing actors  were fighting for the role after casting  actress shailene woodley as the female  lead directors were looking for her  counterparts their search ended with  five actors the top two being Nick  Robinson and Ansel Elgort despite having  a great sense of confidence and  on-screen presence directors did not see  Robinson as the next Augustus they  wanted someone who could be charming coy  and confident to the tee al gore's  proved to be the better fit for the role  however this is mostly because he and  Woodley had worked together before and  their chemistry was off the charts can  you imagine watching The Fault in Our  Stars and seeing Robinson on the screen  instead of Elgort we sure can while he  might have lost the role to Al Gore to  producers and directors kept him in mind  for future roles a few years later the  same people responsible for this film  approached Robinson with the role of  Simon in love Simon and the rest is  history  he's been pigeon holed into high school  roles if there's one thing every young  actor soon finds out it's the branching  out into grown-up movies can take time  Robinson might be 22 years old  but he's still being approached for high  school roles the actor seems to dislike  these types of opportunities however  he's not going to be turning them down  anytime soon during an interview with  Ellen DeGeneres Robinson stated that  he's excited to graduate from the  adolescent genre when asked why he  seemed to think that he was too old to  be getting into a high school or shoes  while this may be true it's very common  for older actors to play younger roles  as a matter of fact most of the actors  you see on screen are pretending to be a  decade younger than they actually are  take Rachel McAdams as an example this  star was 26 years old while filming for  Mean Girls sure she might have looks  like a regular high school student but  she was anything but Robinson might want  to get his hands on some more  challenging scripts but taking what he  can get is never a bad idea the star was  tired of acting in these types of  productions prior to filming love Simon  but he did not want to miss out on the  opportunity of a lifetime  breanne that's the most action I've seen  in weeks what do we got here Nick was  nervous about playing a gay character  when an actor lands a role that's only  normal for them to feel a little nervous  this is because they have a job to do  and if they don't do it well it can harm  their career all in all actors have a  lot of stress attached to their job when  asked about what was going through his  mind when he landed this dream role  Robinson said that he felt a certain  sense of responsibility this is because  he knew that properly representing the  LGBTQ community would be a must in  addition Robinson was also a little  nervous because loved Simon had been a  book before it was a movie and he wanted  to stay true to his character for the  fans at first  Robinson was very nervous to play  Simon's role but director Greg Berlanti  was adamant that he was perfect for the  job after speaking to Berlanti Robinson  felt better and decided to do his own  interpretation of the character what  attracted Robinson to this role was the  fact that a movie starring a gay  teenager had never been done before he  was eager to become the first actors to  get onboard with the movement do you  think Robinson nailed his role if so let  us know in the comments John Lennon and  Yoko Ono oh I thought she was a girl  from the rain  and you were Jesus Nick's high-school  experience was one of a kind high school  the troubling time for a lot of people  which is why so many movies are created  in this setting  during an interview Robinson admitted  that he was actually popular in high  school however his road to victory was a  short one  since Robinson's dream was to become an  actor his schooling sometimes fell on  the backburner  after completing his freshman year he  left school to pursue a role that caused  him to have to complete an entire year  of high school online afterwards he  finished junior and senior year in  California where he learned how  difficult it could be to fit in since  being the new kid is never easy Robinson  gave making friends his all and he  wasn't disappointed by the time he began  his senior year the young star started  to gain popularity and actually  administer coming one of the cool kids  popularity turned out to be a lot less  amazing than he'd previously thought  turns out that Robinson had little in  common with his newfound friends the  young actor admits that high school is  hard for everyone and then having the  need to fit in as a horrible feeling he  also said that people who have too much  fun in high school might be in trouble  Nick was almost cast in ready player one  if there's one director we all know and  love it's Steven Spielberg this renowned  artist has a knack for selecting the  perfect actors for his roles but  sometimes things don't work out the way  he wants them to when Spielberg was  working on his movie ready player one he  was a bit confused about who to cast as  his lead his confusion cleared when he  began working with Robinson on the  fourth Jurassic Park installment from  the very second he met him he knew that  he had to have him audition for the lead  role in his upcoming movie at this stage  of the production Spielberg had no idea  if the young actor would be a good fit  but figured it would be worth a shot  Robinson nat wolff and dalton von were  all considered for the role in the end  however Spielberg decided to cast ty  Sheridan as the lead instead Robinson  might have come close to snagging this  role but his time was not wasted after  all now one of the biggest Directors in  the world knows him by name this isn't  life man this is plugged this is  unplugged plugged unplugged how Nick got  famous from a young age Robinson  parents knew that their oldest son was  special not only did he have incredible  cheekbones but he was also obsessed with  the performing arts a good majority of  children have a hard time walking onto  stage and pouring their hearts out but  this was never an issue for Robinson the  young star was born and raised in  Seattle where he quickly learned that he  had enough talent to make it big at 11  years old he landed a role in a Seattle  production called a Christmas Carol and  the audience was blown away his love for  acting took him to different stages  until his acting teacher approached his  parents to tell them that their son  needed to start auditioning for movie  roles Robinson's first role was the one  of Ryder Scanlon in Melissa and Joey he  was a part of this production for a  total of five years before moving on to  bigger and better things after they mean  roles in movies like the kings of summer  Jurassic world and everything everything  his career was pretty much made this  celebrity is currently working on three  different movies so expect to see him on  the big screen sooner than later things  got personal while shooting love Simon  it goes without saying that some  straight actors have a hard time playing  a gay character this is especially true  for people who do not understand or  sympathize with the LGBTQ community  while many love Simon fans speculated on  whether or not Robinson was indeed gay  the truth is that he isn't  however this never stopped him from  wanting to join the movies production  after having a chat with the film's  director Greg Berlanti  Robinson felt inspired and excited to  take on the role at first he was unsure  about whether or not he'd be able to  pull off being gay but Berlanti assured  him that he was the perfect guy for the  job  after gaining the confidence he needed  to do his role justice Robinson began to  bond with the movies actors and crew  during an interview he spoke about how  emotional the last day of filming was  actress Jennifer Garner played the role  of his mother and their last scene  together was definitely a tearjerker the  left Simon crew grew very close which  brought forth a very emotional last day  of filming despite having a cool guy  attitude Robinson is actually a sweet  and caring individual his dedication to  this movie helped a lot of young people  accept themselves and have a coming out  of their own his role in love Simon  helped his brother come out the love  Simon star might seem like a bad boy but  he's actually on the good side  as the oldest brother out of five  children Robinson often finds himself  wanting to protect his siblings as a  result of this he hardly ever mentions  them to reporters in consequence little  is known about the Robinson family  except for one thing of course when  Ellen DeGeneres brought Robin to appear  on her talk show he immediately obliged  it was here that Robinson announced that  his younger brother is actually gay and  that he came out to him while he was  filming love Simon Indians we guessed  that his brother realized how  open-minded his family could be by  accepting that their son was playing a  gay character Robinson proudly told the  world about his brothers coming out and  he looked super happy doing it Robinson  also stated that he hopes this movie  will spark conversations and allow  individuals to accept themselves for who  they are who is your favorite love Simon  character let us know in the comments  and that's it for 10 dark secrets about  Nick Robinson don't forget to check out  our friends at the trendy for plenty of  news about the music scene see you there  [Music]

